<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1">
<title>Webテスト問題検索</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');

  :root{
    --ink:#1c2b3a;
    --paper:#f2ede2;
    --card:#fffdf7;
    --line:#d8cfb8;
    --accent:#8a3324;
    --accent2:#2f5233;
    --muted:#6b6455;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    --sans: 'Zen Kaku Gothic New', 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    min-height:100vh;
  }

  .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 14px 60px;}

  header.top{
    border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom:12px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .kicker{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    color:var(--accent);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:clamp(21px,6vw,32px);
    margin:0 0 6px;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    line-height:1.2;
  }
  .sub{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:1.5;
  }

  /* ---- sticky bar: search input only, kept compact ---- */
  .search-block{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:10px 0 8px;
    z-index:5;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .search-box{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    border:2.5px solid var(--ink);
    background:var(--card);
    box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
  }
  .search-box input{
    flex:1;
    min-width:0;
    border:none;
    background:transparent;
    padding:12px 10px;
    font-size:16px; /* >=16px prevents iOS auto-zoom */
    font-family:var(--sans);
    color:var(--ink);
    outline:none;
  }
  .search-box .icon{
    display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 10px;
    color:var(--accent);
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-weight:700;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .search-box .clear-btn{
    border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);
    font-family:var(--mono);cursor:pointer;padding:0 12px;
    font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0;
    height:44px;
  }
  .search-box .clear-btn:active{color:var(--accent);}

  .status-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin-top:8px;
    gap:8px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .hint{
    font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);
    font-family:var(--mono);
  }
  .filter-toggle{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    background:var(--card);
    border:1.4px solid var(--ink);
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:6px 10px;
    border-radius:3px;
    cursor:pointer;
    white-space:nowrap;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .filter-toggle.active{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}

  /* ---- filter panel: NOT sticky, collapsed by default ---- */
  .filter-panel{
    display:none;
    background:var(--card);
    border:1.4px solid var(--line);
    padding:10px;
    margin-top:8px;
    max-height:260px;
    overflow-y:auto;
  }
  .filter-panel.open{display:block;}
  .filter-panel-head{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .filter-panel-head button{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:11px;
    background:none;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--muted);
    padding:3px 8px;
    border-radius:3px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .chip-list{
    display:flex;
    gap:6px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .chip{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    border:1.4px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--muted);
    padding:7px 10px;
    border-radius:999px;
    cursor:pointer;
    user-select:none;
  }
  .chip.active{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
    border-color:var(--ink);
  }

  .results{margin-top:14px;}
  .empty-state{
    text-align:center;
    padding:50px 16px;
    color:var(--muted);
  }
  .empty-state .big{
    font-size:14px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }

  .result-card{
    background:var(--card);
    border:1.4px solid var(--line);
    border-left:5px solid var(--accent2);
    padding:14px 14px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .meta-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    gap:6px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .tag{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:10px;
    color:var(--accent2);
    background:rgba(47,82,51,0.08);
    border:1px solid rgba(47,82,51,0.25);
    padding:2px 7px;
    border-radius:2px;
  }
  .tag.cat{
    color:var(--accent);
    background:rgba(138,51,36,0.07);
    border-color:rgba(138,51,36,0.22);
  }
  .idx{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--muted);}

  .q-text{
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.7;
    white-space:pre-wrap;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    word-break:break-word;
  }
  .q-text mark{
    background:#f4d35e;
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:0 2px;
    border-radius:2px;
  }
  .sub-text{
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:rgba(28,43,58,0.04);
    border-left:3px solid var(--line);
    padding:6px 9px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    white-space:pre-wrap;
    word-break:break-word;
  }

  .ans-block{
    border-top:1px dashed var(--line);
    padding-top:9px;
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .ans-label{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:var(--paper);
    background:var(--accent);
    padding:2px 7px;
    border-radius:2px;
    flex-shrink:0;
    margin-top:1px;
  }
  .ans-text{
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:500;
    white-space:pre-wrap;
    line-height:1.6;
    word-break:break-word;
  }
  .ans-text mark{background:#f4d35e;border-radius:2px;}

  .load-more{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    margin:16px auto 0;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:13px;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
    border:none;
    padding:12px 22px;
    cursor:pointer;
    letter-spacing:0.05em;
  }
  .load-more:active{background:var(--accent);}

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:30px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
  }

  ::selection{background:#f4d35e;}

  @media (min-width:600px){
    .wrap{padding:28px 18px 80px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="top">
      <div class="kicker">Webテスト対策 / 過去問データベース</div>
      <h1>問題冒頭 検索ツール</h1>
      <div class="sub">問題文の冒頭を入力すると、該当する問題と答えを表示します</div>
    </header>

    <div class="search-block">
      <div class="search-box">
        <span class="icon">Q</span>
        <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="問題文の冒頭を入力（例：宮沢賢治は）" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
        <button class="clear-btn" id="clearBtn">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="status-row">
        <span class="hint" id="hintText"></span>
        <button class="filter-toggle" id="filterToggleBtn">種類で絞り込み ▾</button>
      </div>
      <div class="filter-panel" id="filterPanel">
        <div class="filter-panel-head">
          <span id="filterCountLabel">全シート対象</span>
          <button id="filterClearBtn">絞り込み解除</button>
        </div>
        <div class="chip-list" id="filterChips"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="results" id="results"></div>
    <button class="load-more" id="loadMoreBtn" style="display:none;">さらに表示</button>

    <footer>アップロードされたExcelから自動抽出・重複除去済み / 全<span id="footCount"></span>件収録</footer>
  </div>

